# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:437
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_147743d0:

    # ADARA @ talk "Let’s get out of here before someone sees us."
    ADARA @ talk "누가 우리 보기 전에 여기서 나가자."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:438
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_5a1cf5d9:

    # "The two of left the alleyway as inconspicuously as possible back onto the lit main streets."
    "두 사람은 가능한 한 눈에 띄지 않게 골목을 빠져나와 불 밝힌 큰길로 돌아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:440
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_9fad39ff:

    # ADARA @ talk "W-Will you walk me back?"
    ADARA @ talk "바-바래다 줄래?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:441
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_f468e918:

    # MC @ talk "...Of course, Adara."
    MC @ talk "...물론이지, 아다라."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:442
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_2c8defd5:

    # "Adara, taking a hold of my hand, let me escort her back home."
    "아다라는 내 손을 잡고, 내가 그녀를 집까지 바래다주게 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:447
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_1141ad58:

    # "Along the way, she leaned in and rested her head onto my chest as we walked across the bridges back towards her humble home, saying very little along the way."
    "가는 길에, 그녀는 몸을 기대어 내 가슴에 머리를 기댔고, 우리는 다리를 건너 그녀의 소박한 집으로 향하며 함께 걸으면서 거의 말이 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:448
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_0aa2e2ae:

    # ADARA @ joy "Well... Thanks for walking me back [player_name!t]."
    ADARA @ joy "음... 바래다줘서 고마워 [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:449
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_e9705bb3:

    # MC @ talk "Yes... Adara, we should talk about-"
    MC @ talk "응... 아다라, 우리 이야기 좀-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:450
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_0cce171f:

    # ADARA @ joy "Another time."
    ADARA @ joy "다음에."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:451
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_ef7b8e44:

    # ADARA @ joy "T-Tonight, I don’t want to think anymore."
    ADARA @ joy "오-오늘 밤은, 더 이상 생각하고 싶지 않아."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:452
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_c248d5b4:

    # MC @ talk "...Alright, if that’s what you want."
    MC @ talk "...알았어, 그게 네가 원하는 거라면."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:454
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_df80bc11:

    # "Adara softly smiled and waved as she opened the doors to her home, slowly closing the door behind her with a silently mouthed ‘bye.’"
    "아다라는 부드럽게 미소 지으며 손을 흔들고 집 문을 열었다가, 조용히 입 모양으로 ‘잘 가’라고 하며 천천히 문을 닫았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:455
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_ad091ea1:

    # "And like that, I was alone again."
    "그리고 그렇게, 나는 다시 혼자가 되었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:456
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_9d8f7bf6_1:

    # MC @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC @ talk "{i}*한숨*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/AProperReunion/scr_reunion_tavern.rpy:457
translate kr qst_reunion_tavern_3e1bc411:

    # "What am I going to do about all this?"
    "이 모든 걸 어떻게 해야 하지?"

